  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758947,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Great Games II - Mask (Commodore 64)\n\nEnter a world of espionage and intrigue in *Mask*, a thrilling action-adventure game for the Commodore 64. You play as a secret agent tasked with infiltrating a heavily guarded fortress to rescue a captured colleague and uncover a sinister plot. The fortress is teeming with patrolling guards, laser grids, and deadly traps, demanding stealth, quick reflexes, and clever puzzle-solving.\n\n*Mask* blends elements of classic stealth games with engaging platforming. Utilize disguises to blend in with the enemy, strategically deploy gadgets like smoke bombs and grappling hooks, and master the art of silent takedowns. The game features vibrant, detailed graphics and a memorable soundtrack that enhances the immersive atmosphere. \n\nExplore a variety of environments, from opulent ballrooms to treacherous underground tunnels, each presenting unique challenges.  Unravel the mystery behind the fortress’s operations and confront the mastermind behind the operation in a final, climactic showdown. *Mask* is a captivating experience that will test your skills and keep you on the edge of your seat."
    },
